  dct:description "The current call for tenders will result in a multiple framework contract with reopening of competition supporting the 4th phase of the Copernicus Emergency Management Service (CEMS). The framework contract will  provide the contracting authority with a flexible products service (FLEX), consisting of on-demand provision of geospatial information which supports emergency management activities not related to the immediate response phase. This FLEX service addresses prevention, preparedness, disaster risk reduction and/or recovery phases."@en;
  dct:title "FRAMEWORK SERVICE CONTRACT FOR COPERNICUS EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT SERVICE (CEMS) RISK AND RECOVERY MAPPING (RRM) TAILOR-MADE PRODUCTS (FLEX)"@en;
